1
00:00:00,422 --> 00:00:03,622
(Amy:)How exactly does a bump feel Asian?

2
00:00:04,426 --> 00:00:06,416
(Amy:)Put him on the phone.

3
00:00:06,728 --> 00:00:09,558
Sheldon, I'm not driving over there again.

4
00:00:09,765 --> 00:00:12,395
(Amy:)Because I drove over there yesterday
for a brain tumor...

5
00:00:12,601 --> 00:00:14,861
(Amy:)...that turned out to be
an ice-cream headache.

6
00:00:16,705 --> 00:00:20,435
(Amy:)Yes, I still want to be
your emergency contact.

7
00:00:21,777 --> 00:00:26,767
(Amy:)Yes, you can eat your ice cream too fast
and also have a brain tumor.

8
00:00:29,785 --> 00:00:31,545
(Amy:)I'm on my way.

9
00:00:34,022 --> 00:00:36,322
Brain tumor would explain a lot.

